=== 8. the display policy that came back with it (the reversible lever) ===
    before: ActiveOutputs=(ii) 0 0  backlight=0  panel_status=suspend
    busctl --system call com.lomiri.Repowerd /com/canonical/Unity/Screen \
      com.canonical.Unity.Screen keepDisplayOn
    after:  ActiveOutputs=(ii) 1 0  backlight=118  panel_status=alive   (held for 30 s+)

